This sample article demonstrates the typography and code formatting used throughout the blog.

## Give motion one job

A short transition can connect two states. A small response can acknowledge a press. Assigning one purpose to a transition makes it easier to judge its timing.

```css
.control {
  transition: opacity 160ms ease-out;
}
```

Test how it feels with a trackpad, a keyboard, and on a phone. The controls should make sense with reduced motion enabled too.
